; [town] spec 6.2. Same card frame as the shop's rows (icon medallion + info,
; Compare behind the shared swipe gesture), but the primary action area is two
; equal-width buttons - Compare and Equip/Unequip - not a Sell bar. Styleboxes
; are a per-scene duplicate set, this project's own convention (see
; shop_sell_row.tscn's header).
